{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The original’s joke is the product: a black T-shirt with a live Unix timestamp that freezes when you buy it. I’m keeping that idea, including fitted/unisex options, and giving it a bold yellow “time is running out (literally)” storefront. Checkout will run in test mode, so you can exercise the whole flow without charging a card or printing a shirt."}}
